      },
      {
        "label": "Offering dialogue and attribution",
        "text": "Grand Master Shaof is beaming with pride and admiration at your progress.\n\n\"You have done impressively in your training. You have developed yourself adaquately in your understanding of the Jin. I believe you are ready for one final task.\"\n\n\"The Ra'Jin are led by a grand master of their own. He is secretive and remains hidden within a secret room in the center of the fortress.\"\n\n\"If you are up to the challenge, find others like you and come together to defeat him. Without their grandmaster, the Ra'Jin will be greatly crippled and balance may yet be restored.\"",
        "html": "<div class=\"tooltip\">Grand Master Shaof is beaming with pride and admiration at your progress.\n\n\"You have done impressively in your training. You have developed yourself adaquately in your understanding of the Jin. I believe you are ready for one final task.\"\n\n\"The Ra'Jin are led by a grand master of their own. He is secretive and remains hidden within a secret room in the center of the fortress.\"\n\n\"If you are up to the challenge, find others like you and come together to defeat him. Without their grandmaster, the Ra'Jin will be greatly crippled and balance may yet be restored.\"\n        </div>",
